=2 Walkthrough
!Jugner Forest (S) Map.jpg||Map of Jugner Forest (S)
* Speak to {n:Amaura} in {z:Southern San d'Oria} HP #4 at (G-6). She will request a {i:Cernunnos Bulb|Cernunnos Bulb|2728}.
** **(Optional)** Speaking to {n:Amaura} again will have her restate some recycled dialogue about {@k}{k:Cernunnos resin}.
** The fastest route to her would be to take Home Point #4 for {z:Southern San d'Oria}.
** If you did not farm one after {M:Dancers in Distress|Dancers in Distress|Dancers in Distress} as recommended, kill {m:Wandering Saplings|Wandering Sapling} in {z:Jugner Forest (S)} for a {i:Cernunnos Bulb|Cernunnos Bulb|2728}.
* Trade the {i:Cernunnos Bulb|Cernunnos Bulb|2728} to {n:Amaura} and watch the cutscene.
** **(Optional)** She'll state she's busy brewing a powerful potion if you speak to her again.
* Trade the {i:Cernunnos Bulb|Cernunnos Bulb|2728} to the **Humus-rich Earth** in {z:Jugner Forest (S)} at (E-6) to plant it.
** The fastest way to get here is using the {p:Campaign Arbiter|Campaign Arbiters} warp and riding a mount Northwest.
** Alternatively, you can take the {p:Survival Guide} to {z:Jugner Forest (S)}.
** Be careful of aggro from the {m:Lobisons|Lobison} in the area.
* Now time travel to {z:Jugner Forest} (Present Day) and examine the **Humus-rich Earth** at the same spot for a cutscene.
** The {p:Outpost} warp for {p:Norvallen} will take you fairly close and the {p:Voidwatch} warp is a little farther.
** Alternatively, you can take the {p:Survival Guide} to {z:Jugner Forest}.
* Examine the **Humus-rich Earth** again to spawn the mob {m:Cernunnos}.
** **Cernunnos** is a {p:Treant-type|Category:Treant} mob that can cast spells such as Protect IV, Shell IV, Stone IV, Stonega III.
* Examine the **Humus-rich Earth** again after defeating **Cernunnos** to obtain the {@k}{k:Cernunnos resin}.
* Return to {n:Amaura} with the key item for a cutscene.
* Speak to {n:Amaura} after waiting until the next game day and zoning to obtain the {@k} {k:Bottle of treant tonic} and complete the mission.
** **(Optional)** She'll suggest you do some household chores for her if you speak with her before then. If you speak to her after the day has changed but without zoning, she'll tell you she's busy brewing a powerful potion.
** You may be required to talk to her multiple times if you are currently doing the {q:To Cure a Cough|To Cure a Cough|To Cure a Cough} quest. {@k}{k:Cough medicine} is not the required key item.

